":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"F_bDaJUteUVm0dGNg0uBIw","review_id":"f4HTnr8evFFuGv9zexsgLQ","date":"2007-05-06T22:26:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9301892518997192,"text_excerpt":"I have fond memories of this place. The food is great and its the first place that I ever had a hookah. The staff is really friendly as well. Note: It is very dark in there, somewhat hard to read the menu. Also the DJs in there I think suck... but that is just my opinion."},{"business_id":"F_bDaJUteUVm0dGNg0uBIw","review_id":"odRFPpkupamyCzlKvGoFvA","date":"2007-09-12T07:58:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9090255498886108,"text_excerpt":"Good eats. Great drinks. Grand smokes! Friday night get's crowded so stop by early and taste some flavored tobacco. When the DJ rolls in around 10pm they start charging a entry fee, even if your in there already. Its cheap, pay up. Friday is also ladies night! It's great for a date, the decor is so seductive. But it's even better with a crowd. Oh and the gangsta's paradise martini is fabby!"},{"business_id":"F_bDaJUteUVm0dGNg0uBIw","review_id":"xbkXRp3sjGssPYxRTcGIKw","date":"2007-11-03T19:42:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9024490714073181,"text_excerpt":"I stumbled into this place and loved the star shaped lanterns on the ceiling. A little bit Morocco, I remember the ambiance was chill and they had a nice selection of shisha - including the classic double apple and an interesting rosemary (Cough cough, my guilt from smoking hit the ceiling, but doing so annually can't be THAT great a harm :) Most importantly, they give you new plastic mouthpieces for the hookah pipes thrown away afterwards which is KEY to not getting all germafied."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"F_bDaJUteUVm0dGNg0uBIw","photo_id":"b5KPlt7Z2IOZKJsaXPZ01A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/b5KPlt7Z2IOZKJsaXPZ01A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9193325042724609},{"business_id":"F_bDaJUteUVm0dGNg0u